I ran every step in `収集手順.md` (steps 1–9) for today's 00:00 run (Fri 2026-10-23), and added **19 records** to `data/catch-log.js`.

- **Added:** 11 in Tokyo Bay (2 in the inner bay, 9 on the Miura side of the bay mouth), 8 in Sagami Bay, 0 in Suruga Bay. All are 10/22 trips posted on chowari.
- **Where they came from:** chowari had 29 new posts. I kept only those in the target areas with target species. Fish outside the list (yellowfin tuna, イサキ and so on) appear only in each record's result text.
